ddle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle saw 230% of normal in June to July and 22% in November to December. Every grid had its driest year in 2012, and grids 25625 and 25925 got just 50% of normal that year.</p>"}
